1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,799
The endodermis also does something active.

2
00:00:02,799 --> 00:00:08,476
It pumps ions into the xylem, and the Casparian strip stops them leaking back.

3
00:00:08,476 --> 00:00:13,919
Water follows them by osmosis and builds a push from below: root pressure.

4
00:00:13,919 --> 00:00:18,906
Cut a pidalu stem early in the morning and sap wells out of the stump.

